### ========================================
### 可用流程列表测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（zhangsan - 员工角色）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 获取可用流程列表 - 默认分页（使用员工账号）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/available-definitions
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 获取可用流程列表 - 指定页码和数量
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/available-definitions?pageNum=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 获取可用流程列表 - 未登录（应返回 401）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/available-definitions

### ========================================
### 新建草稿功能测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（zhangsan - 员工角色）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 新建草稿 - 正常创建（请假流程 ID=1）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 1,
  "formData": "{\"reason\": \"家里有事\", \"days\": 2}"
}

### 新建草稿 - 流程不存在或已禁用
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 999,
  "formData": "{}"
}

### 新建草稿 - definitionId 为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "formData": "{\"reason\": \"测试\"}"
}

### 新建草稿 - formData 为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 1
}


### 新建草稿 - 未登录（应返回 401）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "definitionId": 1,
  "formData": "{}"
}

### ========================================
### 修改草稿功能测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（zhangsan - 员工角色）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 修改草稿 - 正常修改（假设草稿 ID=1）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "formData": "{\"reason\": \"生病\", \"days\": 3}"
}

### 修改草稿 - 草稿不存在
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts/999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "formData": "{}"
}

### 修改草稿 - formData 为空
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{}

### 修改草稿 - 未登录（应返回 401）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "formData": "{}"
}

### ========================================
### 新建并提交申请功能测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（zhangsan - 员工角色）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 提交申请 - 正常提交（请假流程 ID=1）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 1,
  "formData": "{\"reason\": \"年假休息\", \"days\": 2}"
}

### 提交申请 - 流程不存在或已禁用
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 999,
  "formData": "{}"
}

### 提交申请 - 审批人无法确定（使用 admin 登录，通常管理员没有上级）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 提交申请 - 触发无上级异常（admin 没有 manager_id）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{admin_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 1,
  "formData": "{\"reason\": \"测试无上级情况\", \"days\": 2}"
}

### 提交申请 - formData 格式错误（非 JSON 字符串）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 1,
  "formData": "这不是一个合法的JSON"
}

### 提交申请 - 未登录（应返回 401）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "definitionId": 1,
  "formData": "{}"
}

### ========================================
### 提交草稿功能测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（zhangsan - 员工角色）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 提交草稿 - 正常提交（ID=1，状态从 0 变为 1）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances/1/submit
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 提交草稿 - 草稿不存在
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances/999/submit
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 提交草稿 - 重复提交（尝试再次提交已处于审批中的 ID=2）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances/2/submit
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 登录获取 Token（admin - 用于测试越权）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 提交草稿 - 越权提交（使用 admin 尝试提交 zhangsan 的草稿 ID=1）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances/1/submit
Authorization: {{admin_token}}

### 提交草稿 - 未登录（应返回 401）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances/1/submit

### ========================================
### 撤回申请功能测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（zhangsan - 员工角色）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 撤回申请 - 正常撤回（ID=2，状态从 1 变为 4）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances/2/withdraw
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 撤回申请 - 申请不存在
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances/999/withdraw
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 撤回申请 - 重复撤回（尝试再次撤回已撤回的 ID=2）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances/2/withdraw
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 登录获取 Token（admin - 用于测试越权）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 撤回申请 - 越权撤回（使用 admin 尝试撤回 zhangsan 的申请 ID=2）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances/2/withdraw
Authorization: {{admin_token}}

### 撤回申请 - 未登录（应返回 401）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances/2/withdraw

